-048-chenshe:m002-0314","start":314,"end":316,"surface":"吳廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m002-0337","start":337,"end":339,"surface":"陳勝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002979","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m002-0360","start":360,"end":362,"surface":"陳勝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002979","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe","book_id":"b-shiji-048","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-048-chenshe"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:p003","text":"吳廣素愛人，士卒多為用者。將尉醉，廣故數言欲亡，忿恚尉，令辱之，以激怒其眾。尉果笞廣。尉劍挺，廣起，奪而殺尉。陳勝佐之，并殺兩尉。召令徒屬曰：「公等遇雨，皆已失期，失期當斬。藉第令毋斬，而戍死者固十六七。且壯士不死即已，死即舉大名耳，王侯將相寧有種乎！」徒屬皆曰：「敬受命。」乃詐稱公子扶蘇、項燕，從民欲也。袒右，稱大楚。為壇而盟，祭以尉首。陳勝自立為將軍，吳廣為都尉。攻大澤鄉，收而攻蘄。蘄下，乃令符離人葛嬰將兵徇蘄以東。攻銍、酇、苦、柘、譙皆下之。行收兵。比至陳，車六七百乘，騎千余，卒數萬人。攻陳，陳守令皆不在，獨守丞與戰譙門中。弗勝，守丞死，乃入據陳。數日，號令召三老、豪傑與皆來會計事。三老、豪傑皆曰：「將軍身被堅執銳，伐無道，誅暴秦，復立楚國之社稷，功宜為王。」陳涉乃立為王，號為張楚。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"吳廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m003-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"將尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、對話或未名者待核；普通動詞、詐稱與矯命不當真實人物身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m003-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m003-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m003-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m003-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"陳勝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002979","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m003-0062"